<header class="intro">
<h1>إعداد تطبيق المصادقة</h1>
<p class="tenant"><bdi>&lt;script&gt;alert(&quot;x&quot;)&lt;/script&gt;&#39;o&#39; &amp; co</bdi></p>
</header>
<div class="alert" role="alert" id="form-error">
